stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: fork()
    Created --> Ready: Scheduler adds to queue
    Ready --> Running: Scheduled by CPU
    Running --> Ready: Time slice expired (preemption)
    Running --> Waiting: I/O operation or wait()
    Waiting --> Ready: I/O complete or child exited
    Running --> Zombie: exit() called
    Zombie --> [*]: Parent calls wait()
    
    note right of Zombie
        Zombie state:
        - Process terminated
        - Resources freed
        - Exit status saved
        - Waiting for parent to reap
    end note
    
    note right of Running
        Running state:
        - Executing on CPU
        - Has all resources
        - Can be preempted
    end note
